(c) and describe their subject-matter and nature;(c) list the names of any affiliated corporations referred to in that statement; (d) include a copy of any statements of disclosure filed by the Member under subsections 14(3), 15(1) and 21(3); (e) list the positions and corporations, trade or professional associations and trade unions disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(e); and (f) list any trusts disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(b.1). Todd Doherty · Member of Parliament Declaration type Disclosure Summaries (Code) Disclosure date September 22, 2025 Regime Conflict of Interest Code for Members of the House of Commons Description LiabilitiesMortgage with Investors Group Trust Co Ltd, joint with spouse Loan with TD Canada Trust, joint with spouseInvestment in Private CorporationsSole ownership of TK Style Inc. in Prince George, British Columbia, which operates a hair salon operating as Studio CutsActivitiesPresident, Secretary and Director of TK Style Inc.Spouse's/Common-Law Partner's source(s) of incomeLast and Next 12 months:Employment income from TK Style Inc. Disclosed on September 22, 2025","url":"https://www.ethicscanada.ca/en/public-registry/Details?declarationId=85de6fb9-66fc-4a5d-9210-29d7718b0ec9"}],"other":[]},"lobbying":{"total":264,"first":"2016-01-27","last":"2026-10-20","byYear":{"2016":32,"2017":29,"2018":23,"2019":36,"2020":30,"2021":29,"2022":15,"2023":35,"2024":20,"2025":10,"2026":5},"topSubjects":[["Health",78],["Transportation",58],["Industry",39],["Environment",39],["International Trade",36],["Infrastructure",35],["Fisheries",30],["Employment and Training",29]],"topOrgs":[["Canadian Mental Health Association",12],["BC Dairy Association",11],["Canadian Airports Council",9],["Supply Chain Management Association",7],["Canadian Aquaculture Industry Alliance",6],["Williams Lake First Nation",6],["Canadian Association of Optometrists",5],["Canadian Federal Pilots Association",5]]}}